# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# EMERGEX — files Git should never track
#
# Everything below is generated by the build, the IDE, or a test run.
# Committing it causes constant noise in a shared repository: every
# member's machine regenerates these with different contents, so they
# conflict on almost every pull.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Original project rules (do not remove) ─────────────────────────
.project_runtime/
**/.project_runtime/
**/backups/*.sql
*.pid
*.log

# ── .NET build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe

# ── Visual Studio ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Note: .gitignore does not support trailing comments on a pattern
# line — the whole line is treated as the pattern — so any explanation
# goes on its own line above.
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vsidx
*.futdcache.v2
*.dtbcache.v2
SemanticSymbols.db

# ── Test output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated on every run. The specific run quoted in the Phase 5
# report is preserved separately as evidence, not tracked here.
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# ── Playwright ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.playwright/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# ── NuGet ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
packages/
.nuget/

# ── Application runtime ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Student-uploaded documents must never reach version control.
application/public/uploads/*
!application/public/uploads/.gitkeep

# ── OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ── Editors ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*~
